{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19840","headline":"感兴 · 孟郊","name":"感兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拔心草不死，去根柳亦荣。\n独有失意人，恍然无力行。\n昔爲连理枝，今爲断弦声。\n连理时所重，断弦今所轻。\n吾欲进孤舟，三峡水不平。\n吾欲载车马，太行路峥嵘。\n万物根一气，如何互相倾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}